  "scientific_limits": [
    "All eligible rows are mixed with protected support; eligibility does not imply a per-point semantic identity label.",
    "Registration uses contribution on the same measured group rays. It does not require conditional modes to be within a measured-depth agreement threshold, so it is not a demonstrated depth-consistent geometry match.",
