    "HELD measured-pixel counts are only 26, 9 and 6 for the three groups; temporal/point correlations limit statistical interpretation.",
    "The same nine HELD frames have been inspected across previous heuristic-design rounds. Current numerical parameter selection is BUILD-only, but these frames are no longer an untouched independent test set. Fresh held scenes/views are needed for a strong generalization claim.",
